<div class="Section1">
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
text-transform:uppercase'><a href="/">Главная</a>
- ЕСТЕСТВЕННЫЕ
АЛЬБОМЫ
АКВАРИУМА И
БГ - ПЕСКИ
ПЕТЕРБУРГА - </span><span style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";text-transform:uppercase'>сельские
лэди и
джентельмены<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'>СЕЛЬСКИЕ
ЛЭДИ И
ДЖЕНТЕЛЬМЕНЫ</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><i><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Б.
Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none"><i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Каподастр
на 2-м ладу<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Вступление:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> – 4</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>. </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>
</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:
line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Пограничный
Господь
стучится мне
в дверь,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                     
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>Звеня
бороды своей
льдом.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Он пьёт
мой портвейн
и смеётся,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>E</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Так
сделал бы я;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>А потом,
словно
дьявол с
серебряным
ртом,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                 
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Он
диктует
строку за
строкой,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                  
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>E</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И когда
мне
становится
страшно
писать,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:
"Courier New";color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Говорит,
что строка
моя;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Он
похож на
меня, как две
капли воды,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Нас
путают, глядя
в лицо.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Разве
только на мне
есть кольцо,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>А он без
колец,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
обычно я и ни
то и не сё,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Но
порой я
кажусь
святым;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>А он
выглядит
чёртом, хотя
он Господь,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Но нас
ждёт один
конец;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">             </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Так как
есть две
земли, и у них
никогда<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>Не
бывало общих
границ,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;
layout-grid-mode:line'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'>И
узнавший
путь<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;layout-grid-mode:line'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US;layout-grid-mode:line'>A</span><span style='font-family:
